{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运营与演进","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"continuous-monitoring","title":"持续监控与行为分析","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/operations/continuous-monitoring","wordCount":1564,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"maturity-model","title":"零信任成熟度模型","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/operations/maturity-model","wordCount":1495,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-strategy","title":"零信任迁移策略","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/operations/migration-strategy","wordCount":1556,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 运营与演进\n\n零信任不是一次性部署的项目，而是持续演进的安全运营模式。本章覆盖持续监控与行为分析的闭环验证机制、CISA 零信任成熟度模型的度量框架、以及从传统 VPN 架构迁移到零信任的分阶段实施策略。\n\n三篇文档从\"如何持续验证\"到\"如何度量进展\"再到\"如何安全迁移\"，为已决定采纳零信任的团队提供运营层面的完整指引。\n"}